                "message": "Avoid multithreading when driven by setuptools\n\nHopefully fixes #7997 (although I didn't personally manage to\nreproduce the bug(s) either with or without it. Although I also\nsuspect it's very intermittent).\n\nI don't think Cython itself is thread-safe (or easily made\nthread-safe, because there's lots of little bits of global state).\nTherefore I think the easiest solution is to run it in isolated\nprocesses when called in parallel by setuptools.",
